<Base title="Vehicle Transport Condition — How It Was" description="Walk around your vehicle and document its condition before collection.">
  <section class="product-hero wrap"><div><span class="section-index">VEHICLE TRANSPORT / PREVIEW</span><h1>Before the keys<br/><em>change hands.</em></h1><p class="lead">Your car is going on a transporter. Take a few minutes to document its condition before it leaves your sight.</p><a class="button button-dark" href="/vehicle-transport/capture/">Start the walkthrough <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><p class="microcopy">Free preview · Photos remain on your device · No account</p></div><div class="product-panel"><span class="panel-small">A BETTER STARTING POINT</span><h2>One clear walk around your vehicle.</h2><ul><li>Vehicle and collection details</li><li>Eight guided exterior views</li><li>Optional details and existing marks</li><li>A review you can save on this device</li></ul></div></section>
  <section class="section wrap"><div class="section-heading narrow"><span class="section-index">BEFORE YOU START</span><h2>Have your vehicle nearby.</h2><p>Good light helps. Include the whole vehicle in each exterior photo, then take close-ups of marks you want to note. Do this as close to collection as practical.</p></div><div class="honesty-box"><strong>What this preview does</strong><p>It organises your photos and descriptions into a draft on this device. It does not yet upload, preserve, seal or independently verify them. Don’t rely on this preview as your only copy of important evidence.</p></div></section>
</Base>
